   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyrUV",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "I am standing for the Green Party because I believe the Green Party vision that there is enough in Aotearoa New Zealand for all of us. We have everything we need to ensure affordable living and a healthy environment. Epsom deserves someone who fights for working people. Whether you're a student struggling with food insecurity, a young family trying to make ends meet, or seniors needing help and support, I am your representative for Epsom."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyrWg",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "As an MP, I have proven to be thorough, principled, and effective. I believe that MPs are conduits for the voices of our communities, and I am grateful to those who have shared your story with me over these past years. I have also been part of successful campaigns and advocacy for our communities as an MP across a range of portfolios, such as education, seniors, ethnic communities, and overseas New Zealanders."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyrYr",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Ensure affordable living by reducing the cost of groceries, power, and transport."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyrb2",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Ensure Hobson Bay is safe for recreational use by strengthening rules for wastewater discharges."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyrdD",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Advocate for a new co-ed public high school at the site of Epsom campus."
     }
    ],
